# A demo of every kind of slide. Build it with:
#   coax/web/tool.sh deck docs/decks/demo.deck ~/Desktop/openagents-demo-deck.pdf
# The format is in docs/web/decks.md.

deck OPENAGENTS · DEMO DECK
base https://openagents.com

slide
background / wait=8000
kicker OPENAGENTS / DEMO
title OPENAGENTS
subtitle Three years of research and infrastructure, now shipping as releases anchored by the Verse.

slide
kicker OPENAGENTS / VERSE
title THE VERSE
subtitle WORLDS YOU PLAY IN THE BROWSER
grid 3x2
scene /realms/orbit-league?stage=highlight&card=1 wait=7000 | ORBIT LEAGUE | Rocket roadster ball in orbit
scene /realms/hold-the-stair?stage=highlight&card=1 wait=7000 | HOLD THE STAIR | Tower defense on SRD 5e rules
scene /realms/belt-2200?stage=highlight&card=1 wait=7000 | BELT 2200 | Strategy on the real orbits of 2200
scene /realms/dead-gears?card=1 wait=8000 | DEAD GEARS | Hold a ship's hold against three waves
scene /realms/hecates-cemetery wait=9000 | HECATE'S CEMETERY | A memorial garden you walk with your dog
scene /realms/everglade wait=9000 | EVERGLADE | A forest city with quests

slide
kicker OPENAGENTS / VERSE
title MAKE A REALM
grid 2x1
text | WHAT YOU DO | Invite only
  - Describe a world in a sentence: "a stone courtyard with a fountain".
  - The planner turns it into a typed plan: walls, a centrepiece, a layout, paths and water.
  - Walk it, move anything, undo any edit, then publish. Visitors see the published version.
  Every realm can be forked. The fork records its parent and revision.
scene /realms/the-grid wait=9000 | THE GRID | The homepage's live projects, walked

slide
kicker OPENAGENTS / NUMBERS
title WHERE THINGS STAND
grid 3x1
stat 9 | REALMS | Live on openagents.com/realms
stat 103 | CHAPTERS | Nostr From Scratch, 10 implemented
stat 0.46 | COAX | The compiler, released from main

slide
kicker OPENAGENTS / STACK
title ONE LANGUAGE UNDER IT ALL
grid 1x1
diagram | THE STACK | Each box is built in Coax
  node coax 0 1 COAX
  node aethyr 1 0 AETHYR ENGINE
  node psionic 1 1 PSIONIC
  node nostr 1 2 NOSTR
  node verse 2 0 THE VERSE
  node pylon 2 1 PYLONS
  node wallet 2 2 WALLETS
  edge coax aethyr compiles
  edge coax psionic compiles
  edge coax nostr compiles
  edge aethyr verse runs
  edge psionic pylon serves models on
  edge nostr wallet signs for

slide
kicker OPENAGENTS / VERSE
title HOLD THE STAIR
subtitle THE LAST WAVE
grid 1x1
scene /realms/hold-the-stair?stage=highlight&card=1 wait=8000 | WAVE 40 OF 40 | A realm made by Marc

slide
background /realms/orbit-league?stage=highlight&card=1 wait=7000
kicker OPENAGENTS / PLAY
title OPENAGENTS.COM/REALMS
subtitle Every world in this deck is live. Open it in a browser and play.
